  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2909.03 Compliance Verification",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-11-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2909.03 Compliance Verification. The department shall verify compliance by one or more of the following means, as needed to make an accurate compliance determination:\n\n(a) Inspecting facility operating records;\n\n(b) Obtaining information on allowance deduction and transfers from the ATS;\n\n(c) Obtaining information on emissions from the ETS;\n\n(d) Information relative to testing emission monitoring devices; and\n\n(e) Requiring the affected source to conduct emissions testing under the supervision of the department.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (formerly Env-A 2913.04); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2900.html"
